</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.49" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.49.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.49.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.p47" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.p47.1" class="ltx_p">  - Feature: "Explaining concepts through metaphors"</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.50" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.50.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.50.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.p48" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.p48.1" class="ltx_p">- **Example 2:**</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.51" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.51.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F11.pic1.1.51.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
