<span id="A4.F11.pic1.p71" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F11.pic1.p71.1" class="ltx_p">Consider the "Positive Examples" and "Negative Examples" when you judge whether each feature is positive or negative. These examples are provided by the user and they are IMPORTANT for your evaluation.</span>
