<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p59" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p59.1" class="ltx_p">      # Additional features follow same structure</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.62" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.62.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.62.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p60" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p60.1" class="ltx_p">    overall_justification: &lt;summarize the analyses for all fragments&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.63" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.63.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.63.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p61" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p61.1" class="ltx_p">    keyphrase: &lt;short phrase capturing the essence of your justification&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.64" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.64.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.64.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p62" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p62.1" class="ltx_p">```</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.65" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.65.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.65.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.66" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.66.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.66.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p64" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p64.1" class="ltx_p">### YAML Formatting Guidelines</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.67" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.67.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.67.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p65" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p65.1" class="ltx_p">- Use exactly **2 spaces per indentation level**.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.68" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.68.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.68.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.68.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.68.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:14.7pt;"> </span><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.68.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:299.0pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p66" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p66.1" class="ltx_p">- Indent multiline texts (**analysis**, **fragment**, **feature**) by exactly **8 spaces**.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.69" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.69.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.69.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p67" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p67.1" class="ltx_p">- Always use **|** to denote multiline texts.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.70" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.70.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.70.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p68" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p68.1" class="ltx_p">- Avoid unnecessary blank lines or spaces.</span>
</span></span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.71" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.71.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">User Prompt<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.71.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.72" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.72.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.72.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p69" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p69.1" class="ltx_p">### {criterion name}</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.73" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.73.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.73.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.74" class="ltx_p" style="width:313.7pt;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.74.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="font-size:70%;width:313.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A4.F12.pic1.1.74.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:313.7pt;">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p71" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.F12.pic1.p71.1" class="ltx_p">**Description**: {criterion description}</span>
</span></span></span></span>
